{"id":"H0692","lemma":"אַרְאֵלִי","transliteration":"areli","sayIt":"ar-e-li","language":"Hebrew","partOfSpeech":"","gloss":"Areli","meaning":"A man of the tribe of Gad living at the time of Egypt and Wilderness, first mentioned at Gen.46.16;\nson of: Gad (H1410);\nbrother of: Ziphion (H6837), Haggi (H2291), Shuni (H7764), Ezbon (H0675), Eri (H6179) and Arod (H0720)\n§ Areli = \"lion of God\"\n1) a son of Gad\n2) those of the family of Areli (pater adj-Arelites)","glosses":["areli","arelite"],"count":2,"occurrences":[{"chapterId":"gen-46","v":16,"renderings":{"bsb":"and Areli"}},{"chapterId":"num-26","v":17,"renderings":{"bsb":"and the Arelite","kjv":"of Areli"}}],"elsewhere":[{"ref":"Genesis 46:16","note":"The sons of Gad: Ziphion, Haggi, Shuni, Ezbon, Eri, Arodi, and Areli.","source":"web"},{"ref":"Numbers 26:17","note":"of Arod, the family of the Arodites; of Areli, the family of the Arelites.","source":"web"}],"related":[{"id":"H0675","lemma":"אֶצְבּוֹן","transliteration":"etsbon","gloss":"Ezbon"},{"id":"H1410","lemma":"גָּד","transliteration":"gad","gloss":"Gad"},{"id":"H6837","lemma":"צִפְיוֹן","transliteration":"tsiphyon","gloss":"Ziphion"},{"id":"H2291","lemma":"חַגִּי","transliteration":"chaggi","gloss":"Haggi"},{"id":"H7764","lemma":"שׁוּנִי","transliteration":"shuni","gloss":"Shuni"},{"id":"H6179","lemma":"עֵרִי","transliteration":"eri","gloss":"Eri"},{"id":"H0720","lemma":"אֲרוֹד","transliteration":"arod","gloss":"Arod"},{"id":"H0244","lemma":"אׇזְנִי","transliteration":"ozni","gloss":"Ozni"}],"sources":["STEPBible TBESH/TBESG lexicon (CC BY 4.0)","STEPBible TAHOT/TAGNT tagged text (CC BY 4.0)"]}